  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Never Acted.<lb/>
               <hi rend="smallcaps">Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden.</hi><lb/>
               This present <date when="1811-11-11"><hi rend="allcaps">Monday</hi>, Nov. 11, 1811</date>,<lb/>
               Will be performed a New <hi rend="smallcaps">Comick Opera</hi>, in three acts, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title><hi rend="allcaps">Up To Town.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
              <hi rend="italic"> With new Scenes, Dresses and Decorations.</hi><lb/>
               The Overture and Musick composed by Mess. <hi rend="allcaps">Reeve</hi>, <hi rend="allcaps">Condell</hi>, <hi rend="allcaps">Whitaker</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">T. Welsh</hi>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The principal Characters by</hi></head>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Blanchard</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Sinclair</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Simmons</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fawcett</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Emery</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Atkins</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bishop</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Howell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Huckel</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Louis</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Childe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Ferron</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Davenport</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">The <hi rend="allcaps">Choruses</hi> by</hi></role><lb/>
                     <hi rend="italic">Mess</hi>. <actor>Bishop,</actor> <actor>Duruset,</actor> <actor>Hickman,</actor> <actor>Huckel,</actor> <actor>Norris,</actor> <actor>Street,</actor> <actor>Tinney,</actor> <actor>Williams</actor><lb/>
                     Mesdames <actor>Coates,</actor> <actor>Findlay,</actor> <actor>Hardy,</actor> <actor>Iliff,</actor> <actor>Johnson,</actor> <actor>Ryall.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
              <hi rend="italic">Books of the Songs to be had in the Theatre, price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.</hi><lb/>
               To which will be added a Farce called<lb/>
               <bibl><title>The <hi rend="allcaps">Child</hi> of <hi rend="allcaps">Nature</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Duke Mercia</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chapman</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marquis Almanza</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Egerton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Count Valencia</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Alberto,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Seville,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Creswell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Granda,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Atkins</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Peasant,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Truman</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Attendants,</role> Mess. <actor>Grant,</actor> <actor>Heath,</actor> <actor>Louis,</actor> <actor>Sarjant</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Marchioness Merida</role> by <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Humphries</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Amanthis</role> by <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Attendant,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Cox</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Vivant Rex &amp; Regina.</ab>
         </div>
